alue -0.00301473 m vs independent check -0.00301475 m (diff < 0.001%).\"}, {\"name\": \"Maximum bending moment check\", \"passed\": true, \"detail\": \"FEM value 37495.2 N*m vs independent check 37491.5 N*m (diff ~0.01%).\"}, {\"name\": \"Support shear/reactions check\", \"passed\": true, \"detail\": \"FEM reaction 41768.1 N vs independent check 41761.3 N (diff ~0.02%).\"}, {\"name\": \"Maximum deflection location check\", \"passed\": true, \"detail\": \"Both methods confirm max deflection (~0.003197 m) occurs near x=6.5 m, not at midspan, consistent with Winkler foundation theory.\"}], \"reasoning\": \"All FEM results are consistent with the independent numerical solution of the governing ODE. Discrepancies are minimal and attributable to the different numerical methods (Galerkin FEM vs. strong-form collocation).\"}\n```",
